e if the  rebels have obtained a complete  technical readout of this station it is  possible however unlikely that they  might find a weakness and with that in  mind and or will be more of an origin  story for cassium a tale that shows the  brutality of imperial rule through the  lens of his radicalization in a 2022  interview with vanity fair diego luna  and series creator tony gilroy confirmed  that andor season 1 will begin five  years prior to the events of rogue one  following cassian from the destruction  of his home planet through his early  involvement with the rebel alliance luna  told vanity fair it's a journey of a  migrant that feeling of having to move  is behind this story very profoundly in  the same vanity fair interview gilroy  revealed that genevieve o'reilly's mon  mothma a character first introduced in  return of the jedi will also play a huge  role in the story as one of the key  leaders of the rebel alliance from its  early days to the end of the war she's  certainly an interesting character to  include and it should be interesting to  watch her grow into the leader scene in  the original trilogy  obviously diego luna is the main star of  andor as his character's name is  literally the title of the show from  what's been revealed so far it seems  that genevieve o'reilly will have the  next largest role in the series with her  version of mon mothma serving as a kind  of counterpoint to cassie o'reilly first  played the character originated by  caroline blakiston in revenge of the  sith and she has since reprised the role  in both rogue one and as a voice actor  for star wars rebels  in addition to the two leads a number of  other notable actors have been announced  for the show many in undisclosed roles  veteran actor stellen skarsgard will  play a new character named luthen and  andrea orhona will play an as yet  unnamed character the rest of the  announced cast includes denise guff kyle  soler and fiona shaw in his vanity fair  interview gilro